 *
 * DESCRIPTION
 *	Check if the parent's file descriptors are affected by
 *	actions in the child; they should not be.
 *
 * ALGORITHM
 *	Parent opens a file.
 *	Forks a child which closes a file.
 *	Parent forks a second child which attempts to read the (closed)
 *	file.
 *
 * USAGE
 *	fork08
 *
